meta {
  name: Chat
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  `POST /api/chat` streams **Server-Sent Events** (`text/event-stream`).
  Event order: `status` (search → found → answer) → `thinking`* / `answer`* → `products` → `suggestions` → `done`.
  On failure an `error` event is sent instead. Needs Ollama running; on CPU a reply can take minutes
  (set `CHAT_THINK=false` in `.env` to skip the model's reasoning for faster answers).
}
